The '''Red_Legion Hideout''' is a giant island that only appears when an admin uses a special ability called '''Heaven Kamui''' to create it. This place is said to be the former [[Mygame43 (Player)|King Red Head]]'s hideout according to some admins. This island can only be found in the sky, although its exact location is unknown, as it always disappears.

__TOC__

==Appearance==
From the main gate to the island, small houses and clouds are floating in the air. There are mostly small houses on the island that are empty inside. In the middle of the center, there are also 8 similar empty houses, which are arranged together in balance. If the player continues straight, the user will reach a giant house, and inside they can find the throne of [[Mygame43 (Player)|King Red Head]].

