==Trivia==
* The Red_Legion Hideout is the only island that can change color from white during the day to yellow at night.
* The Red_Legion Hideout is one of the islands that can only appear through [[Commands|admin commands]]. Otherwise, users can make islands appear by performing [[Raids]], finding [[Mirage Island]], [[Treasure Island]], completing the final challenges of the two scrolls in the [[Cursed Dual Katana/Puzzle|Cursed Dual Katana quest]], etc.
* If the user can get here by all means, they are strictly forbidden from sitting on the throne while another admin is watching, this can be seen through many of [[Player:Zioles (Dev)|Zioles]] and [[Uzoth (Admin)|Uzoth]]'s videos on Youtube. That implies that the throne belongs to [[Mygame43 (Player)|King Red Head]], one of the owners of Blox Fruits.
* This place was used during {{Update|29.4}} for the [https://blox-fruits.fandom.com/wiki/Events#Hacker_Event_2026 Hacker Event], and the only inhabitant that belongs here is [[Luckymaxer (Raid Boss)]].

